        "comments": "The assembly daLimAust1.hap1.1 is based on 37x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and plastid genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. The exact order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome 1 (10,749 ? 12,201 Kbp) are unknown. The exact order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome 4 (12,162 ? 13,504 Kbp) are unknown. The exact order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome 6 (9,486 ? 9,747 Kbp) are unknown. The exact order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome 8 ( 23,732 ? 24,348 Kbp) are unknown. The exact order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome 10 (11,870 ? 12,328 Kbp) are unknown.",
